                "claim": "Cleared accepts any non-empty exempted slice as clearing a head with no results. It does not itself verify that each Exempted entry passed CheckExemption and CheckBinding; it relies on the caller (review/app Check, not visible here) to filter before passing. If the caller passes unvalidated exemptions, a tampered exemption file could clear a head. This is a contract dependency, not a demonstrated exploit in this candidate.",
