                  "engine/review/check.go:141-156"
                ],
                "evidence_class": "inferential",
                "causal_disposition": "unknown"
              }
            ],
            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all 5 changed paths. Cleared returns nil only when there are no results and at least one exemption; any result routes to Clearance, so a blocking result always wins, matching the stated intent and the tests.",
              "CheckExemption re-applies CheckRisk then CheckReport on stored data, so edited exemption files are refused at the pure-rule level.",
              "The Exempted type carries only the candidate and path, with no validated marker, so the safety of Cleared depends on the unseen caller validating each exemption first.",
              "No secrets, unsafe input handling, or dependency changes were introduced; review.go and stored.go changes are comment-only."
            ]
          }
